    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        69.16120147705078,
        296.2587585449219,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "Staff and managers voiced concerns about:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        95.91809844970703,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        314.1289367675781,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "sustainability of funding and maintenance;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        95.91809844970703,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        441.35699462890625,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "complex conflicts of interest between donors and implementers; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        95.91809844970703,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        526.9521484375,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "the strategic and equitable use of resources, which negatively affects creating equitable",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.980031967163086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        290.6131286621094,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "access to cartridge-based diagnostics.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        146.84820556640625,
        206.1001434326172,
        159.7292022705078
      ],
      "text": "QES: high confidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        162.16119384765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        162.16119384765625,
        526.986328125,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "Access to clear and comprehensible information for TB patients on what TB diagnostics are",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        177.66119384765625,
        526.9620971679688,
        190.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "available to them and how to interpret results is a vital component of equity, and lack of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        193.16119384765625,
        359.2875671386719,
        206.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "such access represents an important barrier for patients.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        208.84820556640625,
        134.57240295410156,
        221.7292022705078
      ],
      "text": "Interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        224.16119384765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        237.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        224.16119384765625,
        527.222900390625,
        237.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "New treatment options need to be matched with new diagnostics. It is important to improve",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.958572387695312,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        239.66119384765625,
        526.9421997070312,
        252.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "access to treatment based on new diagnostics and to improve access to diagnostics for new",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.984289169311523,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        255.16119384765625,
        179.69439697265625,
        268.30621337890625
      ],
      "text": "treatment options.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        270.84820556640625,
        134.57240295410156,
        283.72918701171875
      ],
      "text": "Interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        288.99591064453125,
        78.81909942626953,
        302.14093017578125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        288.99591064453125,
        526.6109619140625,
        302.14093017578125
      ],
      "text": "The speed at which WHO guidelines are changing does not match the speed at which many",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.979230880737305,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        304.49591064453125,
        526.9642333984375,
        317.64093017578125
      ],
      "text": "country programmes are able to implement the guidelines. This translates into differential",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        319.99591064453125,
        301.9456481933594,
        333.14093017578125
      ],
      "text": "access to new TB diagnostics and treatment:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        335.49591064453125,
        95.91809844970703,
        348.64093017578125
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        335.49591064453125,
        526.9808959960938,
        348.64093017578125
      ],
      "text": "between countries (i.e. between those that can and cannot quickly keep up with the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        350.99591064453125,
        348.1429748535156,
        364.14093017578125
      ],
      "text": "rapidly changing TB diagnostic environment); and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        366.49591064453125,
        526.9645385742188,
        379.64093017578125
      ],
      "text": "within countries (i.e. between patients who can and cannot afford the private health",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        366.5289306640625,
        93.1460952758789,
        380.5539245605469
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "SourceSansPro-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        381.99591064453125,
        483.4591979980469,
        395.14093017578125
      ],
      "text": "system that is better equipped to quickly adopt new diagnostics and policies).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        397.68292236328125,
        153.39910888671875,
        410.56390380859375
      ],
      "text": "Interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        415.83050537109375,
        78.81909942626953,
        428.97552490234375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        415.83050537109375,
        527.0843505859375,
        428.97552490234375
      ],
      "text": "The identified challenges with the use of NAATs for detection of TB and DR-TB, and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        431.33050537109375,
        527.0362548828125,
        444.47552490234375
      ],
      "text": "accumulated delays, risk compromising the added value as identified by the users, ultimately",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.959927558898926,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        446.83050537109375,
        526.7098388671875,
        459.97552490234375
      ],
      "text": "leading to underuse. The challenges also hamper access to prompt and accurate testing and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.970510482788086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        462.33050537109375,
        305.673828125,
        475.47552490234375
      ],
      "text": "treatment, particularly for vulnerable groups.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        478.01751708984375,
        187.27345275878906,
        490.89849853515625
      ],
      "text": "QES: high confidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        504.82305908203125,
        336.63482666015625,
        517.737060546875
      ],
      "text": "Is the intervention acceptable to key stakeholders?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        528.673095703125,
        78.81920623779297,
        541.818115234375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        528.673095703125,
        385.6199951171875,
        541.818115234375
      ],
      "text": "Patients can be reluctant to test for TB or MDR-TB because of:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86620330810547,
        544.173095703125,
        95.91820526123047,
        557.318115234375
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        544.173095703125,
        447.3133850097656,
        557.318115234375
      ],
      "text": "stigma related to MDR-TB or having interrupted treatment in the past;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86620330810547,
        559.673095703125,
        95.91820526123047,
        572.818115234375
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        559.673095703125,
        201.6562042236328,
        572.818115234375
      ],
      "text": "fears of side-effects;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86620330810547,
        575.173095703125,
        95.91820526123047,
        588.318115234375
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        575.173095703125,
        254.99310302734375,
        588.318115234375
      ],
      "text": "failure to recognize symptoms;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86620330810547,
        590.673095703125,
        95.91820526123047,
        603.818115234375
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        590.673095703125,
        264.1471862792969,
        603.818115234375
      ],
      "text": "inability to produce sputum; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86620330810547,
        606.173095703125,
        95.91820526123047,
        619.318115234375
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        606.173095703125,
        418.6145935058594,
        619.318115234375
      ],
      "text": "cost, distance and travel concerns related to (repeat) clinic visits.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        621.860107421875,
        206.10025024414062,
        634.7410888671875
      ],
      "text": "QES: high confidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        640.0076904296875,
        78.81920623779297,
        653.1527099609375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        640.0076904296875,
        420.8086853027344,
        653.1527099609375
      ],
      "text": "Health workers can be reluctant to test for TB or MDR-TB because of:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86620330810547,
        655.5076904296875,
        95.91820526123047,
        668.6527099609375
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        655.5076904296875,
        387.8160705566406,
        668.6527099609375
      ],
      "text": "TB-associated stigma and consequences for their patients;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86620330810547,
        671.0076904296875,
        95.91820526123047,
        684.1527099609375
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        671.0076904296875,
        202.61170959472656,
        684.1527099609375
      ],
      "text": "fear of acquiring TB;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86620330810547,
        686.5076904296875,
        95.91820526123047,
        699.6527099609375
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        686.5076904296875,
        527.1715087890625,
        699.6527099609375
      ],
      "text": "fear from supervisors when reclassifying patients already on TB treatment who turn out",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.990195274353027,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        702.0076904296875,
        195.80357360839844,
        715.1527099609375
      ],
      "text": "to be misclassified;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86620330810547,
        717.5076904296875,
        95.91820526123047,
        730.6527099609375
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        717.5076904296875,
        316.3200988769531,
        730.6527099609375
      ],
      "text": "fear of side-effects of drugs in children; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86620330810547,
        733.0076904296875,
        95.91820526123047,
        746.1527099609375
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        733.0076904296875,
        397.6612548828125,
        746.1527099609375
      ],
      "text": "community awareness of disease manifestations in children.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        748.6947021484375,
        206.10025024414062,
        761.57568359375
      ],
      "text": "QES: high confidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
